- description: This metric evaluates the effectiveness of data refresh processes by comparing actual refresh times against established Service Level Agreements (SLAs). It specifically measures the frequency and punctuality of updates to dashboards, ensuring that users have access to the most current data for decision-making. By flagging dashboards that exhibit stale or lagging updates, this metric highlights potential issues in data governance and content reliability. The scope of this metric encompasses all dashboards within the BI environment, focusing on their ability to deliver timely insights. Ultimately, it serves as a critical indicator of the overall health of the BI system and its capacity to support informed business decisions.

