- description: This metric measures the trend of weekly active users engaging with the Business Intelligence (BI) platform over a specified time period. It provides insights into user adoption patterns, highlighting whether the number of active users is increasing or decreasing. By analyzing this trend, organizations can assess the effectiveness of their BI initiatives and identify potential areas for improvement in user engagement. The metric focuses solely on users who have interacted with the BI tools at least once during the week, ensuring that only genuine engagement is captured. This information is crucial for decision-makers to understand the overall health of BI usage within the organization and to strategize accordingly.

