Metric:
- id: features.alerts_usage
- name: 
- description: This metric measures the frequency with which users configure and utilize alerts within the Business Intelligence platform. It reflects the level of proactive monitoring adoption among users, indicating their engagement with the system's capabilities to receive timely notifications on critical data changes. A higher usage rate suggests that users are actively leveraging alerts to stay informed and make data-driven decisions. Conversely, low usage may highlight a need for increased training or awareness regarding the benefits of alerts. Overall, this metric serves as an indicator of how effectively the BI tools are being utilized to enhance decision support through timely insights.

